Z||000000||theogre||07-03-2001||09:03 PM||||You know, I've seen allot of really stupid crap. This newest episode really pushed it over the edge.<P>I'm not going to pretend I'm best buddies with Cliff but I know him well enough to know this whole thing with Ed or whatever his name is was the last straw.<P>Allot of really ignorant stuff has been going on for while now. Cliff has put up with allot of crap. Now this???? Please.<P>I'm one of the people that asked him about the dash unit. He did such a hard sell I bought 6. Yeah..... Sure.... He's getting rich off this thing.... not.<P>13 CDs.... That total hasn't changed in months. Made a fortune there.... OhhhhK.<P>Ed is a problem, but he's not the only one. There have been several long running BS sessions and the people in them really need to step back and look at the bigger picture.<P>BTW... Don't surf here at work any more... This site, thanks to the behaviour of some people now violates most companies internet use policies becuase of "inapropriate, offensive, sexist, etc," material. (That's assuming a chat/bbs/forum system isn't a violation to start with.) 30 people were released from their jobs at an area bank for material similar to what is in some threads in General and O/T. you'd be amazed what can get you fired now. PC should mean Politicaly Cracked...<P>I thought about putting up a forum someplace before I found this one... Frankly, I've never liked mail/news groups and the other "forums" are/were running on real trash for software. I quickly decided against it because A. I could not afford the cash and B. I didn't need presicely these kind of headaches.<P>Instead I opted for a new tunnel in my cave and working with Cliff on making this place rock.<P>I don't blame Cliff for being a mite peeved. I'm not all to happy myself.<P>I think all forum users need to take this as a time to step back and look at how they use the system. I don't mean everyone is causing problems. that's a small few... But look back at your own stuff and see just how much you'd probably miss this place if/when it's gone for good.<P>------------------<BR><I><B>Screamin Yellow Zonkers... If it's Screamin and Yellow, I ain't eatin it.</B></I>||||reg||1
